// R12 — VERDICT-LOGIC COMPLETION: the four remaining non-cache def_eq phases
// transcribed VERBATIM at their production positions inside the R11 lazy-delta
// phase engine, verified native == JIT (Clean's CIC kernel through Trust:
// Rust -> MIR -> trust-ir -> trust-cg -> machine code).
//
//   * STRUCT-ETA into P6 (def_eq/structural.rs:158-219 try_structure_eta_core
//     + is_structure_like eta.rs:81-86): the [C-structeta] false stub is now
//     the real fieldwise ctor-app-triggered eta; the structure/constructor
//     registry model is extended honestly (get_inductive/get_constructor).
//   * BOOL.TRUE REFLECTION (def_eq/mod.rs:306-327 [C-refl]): one side closed
//     and reducing (with DELTA — the full whnf) to Bool.true, the other
//     literally Bool.true. THE DIVERGENCE ROOT is #3305: whnf unfolds a
//     THEOREM (thmb := Bool.true) but lazy-delta will not — so reflection is
//     the ONLY accepting phase.
//   * P7 STRING-LIT (:461-465 [C-strlit]): the string-literal expansion
//     (String.ofList delta-unfolds to String.mk over the Char list) — verified
//     on the u32-tag + explicit-codepoint model [B-strtag] (the Arc<str> +
//     `chars()` decode is the frontend string-shape gap).
//   * P8 UNIT-LIKE (:467-473 [C-unitlike]): a single-ctor, no-field, in-Type
//     structure — any two of its inhabitants are def-eq by uniqueness.
//
// Each phase: (a) the R12 verdict (phase fires), (b) the R11-config verdict
// (phase stubbed/elided) DIVERGING, (c) real-vs-stub helper, (d) earlier-phase
// no-decision witnesses (phase attribution), (e) a poisoned-registry control
// flipping the verdict. The R11 28-case decl gate is re-run UNCHANGED (the four
// completions are inert on it) — the no-regression proof, native == JIT.
//
// Slice: crates/trust-cg-codegen/tests/slices/clean_phase_completion_slice.rs.
// Boundaries after R12: the elided remainder is EXACTLY the cache layer
// ([C-cache2]: equiv-manager / def_eq cache / branch-sharing / sliding cache),
// the registry-empty reducers ([C-nat]/[C-native]/[C-monad]/iota/quot B8), and
// B4/B5 (heartbeats / CleanMode). P7's Arc<str>+chars() decode is the one
// string-shape frontend gap [B-strtag].
//
// Per-process under `perl -e 'alarm 600; exec @ARGV' -- <bin> --test-threads=1`.

